xt-gray-700\">Core Feature A</span>\n              </li>\n              <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Basic Feature B</span>\n              </li>\n              <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Standard Feature C</span>\n              </li>\n              <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Limited Feature D</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n    \n          \n          <div className=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 sm8 shadow-sm flex flex-col w-full md1/3\">\n            \n            <div className=\"text-center mb-4\">\n              <i className=\"fas fa-seedling text-3xl text-gray-700\"></i> \n            </div>\n            \n            <div className=\"text-center mb-3\">\n              <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1\">Standard</h3>\n              <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">For regular usage</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div className=\"text-center mb-6 min-h-[70px]\">\n              \n              <p className=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1\">$19</p>\n              <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-tight\">Per month, billed annually<br />or $25 billed monthly.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <a href=\"#\"\n              className=\"block w-full bg-gray-900 text-white text-center py-3 px-6 rounded-full font-semibold hover700 transition duration-200 mb-6\">\n              Choose Plan\n            </a>\n            \n            <hr className=\"border-gray-200 mb-6\" />\n            \n            <div className=\"flex-grow\">\n              <p className=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 mb-4\">Everything in Basic, plus:</p>\n              <ul className=\"space-y-3 text-sm\">\n                <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                  <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                  <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Advanced Feature E</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                  <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                  <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Enhanced Feature F</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                  <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                  <span className=\"text-gray-700\">More capacity for Feature B</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                  <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                  <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Collaboration tools</span>\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n    \n          \n          <div className=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-6 sm8 shadow-sm flex flex-col w-full md1/3\">\n            \n            <div className=\"text-center mb-4\">\n              <i className=\"fas fa-tree text-3xl text-gray-700\"></i> \n            </div>\n            \n            <div className=\"text-center mb-3\">\n              <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1\">Premium</h3>\n              <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">For power users & teams</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div className=\"text-center mb-6 min-h-[70px]\">\n              \n              <p className=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1\">From $99</p>\n              <p className=\"text-xs text-gray-500 leading-tight\">Per user / month<br />Volume discounts available.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <a href=\"#\"\n              className=\"block w-full bg-gray-900 text-white text-center py-3 px-6 rounded-full font-semibold hover700 transition duration-200 mb-6\">\n              Contact Us\n            </a>\n            \n            <hr className=\"border-gray-200 mb-6\" />\n            \n            <div className=\"flex-grow\">\n              <p className=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 mb-4\">Everything in Standard, plus:</p>\n              <ul className=\"space-y-3 text-sm\">\n                <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                  <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                  <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Unlimited Feature A & B</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                  <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                  <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Dedicated Support</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                  <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                  <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Advanced Security Options</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                  <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                  <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Custom Integrations</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                  <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                  <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Early access to new features</span>\n                </li>\n                <li className=\"flex items-start\">\n                  <i className=\"feature-checkmark\"></i>\n                  <span className=\"text-gray-700\">Priority processing</span>\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </body>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
